  "releaseNotes": "# [v0.9.0-pre-985fb9bf](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/compare/a3ff9553efe49f3e9e23de6553af20591e54453e...985fb9bf99b6805d89402bcc0ff6414daa8dac9a) (2026-03-24)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* json-seq enumerable detect record separator incorrectly ([620ff8a](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/620ff8a277398cf8fa9bcc8eee8ff5ebb02685b3))\n* **response:** content class name could be mixed pascal case where it doesn't make sense if the media type is not all lower case. NOTE: This is a breaking change if any response media types are defined as not all lower case. ([de03572](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/de03572da7cadb568e6674351f10dc63e859996f))\n* **schema:** request content schema render duplicates due to not resolving the json pointer by following  ([c78091e](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/c78091e48e0c5844a192fe222a94fe663a842808))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **request:** generate sequential json request content ([af4da6d](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/af4da6d2adfdcb4238092d3e4875c336ec6ff050))\n* **response:** support sequential media types jsonl and json-seq ([b24dcb1](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/b24dcb1b05c6e17a51a13920678e638ac34509f6))",
